    <title>A Job Queue on One Postgres Table: Leases,
  Retries and SKIP LOCKED</title>
    <updated>2026-10-08T12:00:00Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.01234v2" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.01234v2" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>We describe a job queue that keeps each job in one row of a Postgres table. Workers
take jobs with FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, so that two workers never take the same job. A
lease with a time limit frees the job of a worker that dies. Code: https://github.com/example/queue-paper.</summary>
